blender-sml-stdlib 0.3.0

Minimal, parseable subset of the OMG SysML v2 standard library, pinned for the
Blender-SML bindings. Derived from the standard library shipped with sml2c;
trimmed to what the pinned sml2c can parse and what the bindings consume.

Only the *domain* libraries are shipped here — the foundational packages
(ScalarValues, Quantities, ISQ, SI) are compiled into sml2c and resolve without
bundling (re-shipping them collides, E0203). The full set of resolvable packages
(bundled + built-in) is catalogued in scripts/startup/bl_ui/
sysml_stdlib_index_generated.py (generate: tools/sysml/gen_stdlib_index.py),
which drives the in-editor library browser (SCRUM-676).

Contents:
  Geometry/  — ShapeItems (solid starter set) + SpatialItems, for the geometry
               binding (SCRUM-624). Maps to Blender mesh primitives.
  Time/      — Occurrences (Occurrence / snapshots / timeSlices) + Time (Clock /
               TimeInstant), for the animation binding (SCRUM-644). Maps to
               Blender keyframes / actions.
